ach  up to 1200 degrees celsius as a result  rodin's external body temperature is  life-threateningly hot upon close  contact he was able to slowly burn  mothra to near death rodin's massive  wings are powerful enough to create  devastating sonic thunderclaps his body  is heavily armored and can withstand  massive amounts of damage his sharp  talents and beak are his main weapons as  well as his extremely hot temperature  plus his wings he can also make  volcanoes explode when flying over them  as described in the novelization  so the first titan that he can clearly  defeat is titanus amhulic although we  can say for a fact that rodan will not  be able to defeat behemoth since  behemoth has fireproof skin but he does  have a clear advantage over amherst the  one who defeated behemoth so it might be  a little bit confusing right if amhulu  can defeat behemoth and rodan cannot  beat behemoth then surely amhulu can  kill rodan right wrong amhulu is  essentially a nervous system with a  massive brain that can tell it  kinetically assemble a body mostly made  of trees and roots of plants and that's  where the disadvantage lies with a  temperature of over 1200 degrees rodan  can just slowly burn amherst into  submission by being near him  so the second tyrant is warbat wabats  are large reptilian serpentine creatures  equipped with two red membranous wings  running down the top half of its body  supported by long spines which are  extensions of their rib cage they can  fly and their main mode of attack is  constriction so you see where i'm going  with this a robot facing off with rodan  will only end with the snake titan being  burned to a crisp the wing membranes  will be vaporized and a constriction  move will only end in its death  so after the warbat the muto male will  be the next island on this list that  will clearly fall against rodan on a  one-on-one fight well versus the two  mutos at once rodin will most likely die  but facing them one on one he will  surely win against them for one the muto  male is physically weaker than rodan and  cannot counter his speed even in the air  and for the case of the female she has  one massive vulnerability she is  hexapetal walks on all six and looks  down while her back faces upwards which  is where rodan is he can just swoop down  and pick her off piece by piece  attacking her back  but then again rodan will not be able to  take on the muto prime as this beast is  something different it has a sonic roll  that can disorient him and extra hard  armor as well as being more flexible in  combat with massive arms that can crush  rodan quickly if it gets its hands on  him  well the next one on this list of losers  is the skull crawler we are not talking  about ramarok the big one from skull  island 2017 it is clearly smaller and  will die in a quick fight but we are  talking about the one from godzilla vs  kong the red skull crawler it is vicious  and hyper carnivorous being ferocious  and very hostile to any living creature  small or titanic but again like the of  female it is clearly disadvantaged  because it is largely terrestrial and  subterranean and so it has never  developed defense mechanisms against  airborne titans and also it isn't armed  enough to withstand rodin's attacks from  the air and his extreme heat  now we come to two flying titans that  can give rodan a run for his money one  is camazotz and the other is shinomura  camazotz is a tough one and the fight  could go either way firstly camazotz has  a supersonic screech that can disorient  the fire demon and can also match his  flight as well as summon storms to  quench his fire but when it comes to the  killing blow kamzas doesn't have one it  does have brute strength as shown in the  fight with kong but it cannot kill rodan  with biting or talents and will  eventually succumb to the relentless  heat  next is shinomura a tyrant that was  hunted constantly by godzilla shinomura  is a swarm to item that lasted a long  while against the king of the monsters  just because it can fly away and fight  another day  shinomura is made up of a ton of smaller  organisms that work in unison and their  main weakness is fire or heat the two  shinamuras were killed by godzilla's  atomic breath and a nuclear bomb so when  it comes to blows between rodan and  shinomura the former would likely win  but it would take quite a while to get  all the smaller collective organisms  burned to a crisp shinamura on the other  hand would be near useless to inflict  damage on rodan except for blunt blows  so there you have it the titans that can  lose against rodan  so i hope you have enjoyed watching this  video and with that we come to the end  of it so hit that like button for  support subscribe and most of all smash  that bell icon for regular updates on  new videos right here on this channel  till the next one take care fam

